flowchart TB
  subgraph Client["Untrusted browser boundary"]
    User[Browser user] --> Workbook[Selected workbook] --> UI[React application]
  end
  subgraph Server["Application server"]
    API[Unauthenticated Express endpoint]
    DB[(MongoDB user collection)]
    Mail[Nodemailer transport]
    API --> DB
    DB --> Mail
    API --> Mail
  end
  subgraph External["External provider"]
    Gmail[Gmail]
    Mail --> Gmail
  end
  UI -->|HTTP JSON| API
  API -->|Recipient array currently logged| Logs[Application logs]
